    "text": {
     "en": "Vocation means a job or occupation. A gong is a metal disc that gives a loud sound when struck.\nA lane is a narrow path. A giant is a huge imaginary creature. A spade is a digging tool, and a lantern is a portable lamp.\nTools: hammer, camera, screwdriver, sickle, stethoscope, grater, tongs, compass, mouse, saw, telescope.\nUse each word in a sentence."
